==================== Input ====================
// A continuation line inside a parenthesized expression sits one level under the expression,
// whether the width or a `//` comment broke the line (see DIVERGENCES.md "line-comment-continuation-indent")
$a1: ($column-width * // c
  $columns) + 1;
$a2: ($column-width * $a-very-long-variable-name-that-forces-the-line-to-wrap-somewhere-ok) + 1;
$b1: $column-width * // c
  $columns;

